{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02977","headline":"郡舍南有园畦杂树聊以永日 · 张九龄","name":"郡舍南有园畦杂树聊以永日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郡久无补，越乡空复深。\n苟能秉素节，安用叨华簪。\n却步园畦里，追吾野逸心。\n形骸拘俗吏，光景赖闲林。\n内讼诚知止，外言犹匪忱。\n成蹊谢李径，衞足感葵阴。\n荣达岂不伟，孤生非所任。\n江城何寂历，秋树亦萧森。\n下有北流水，上有南飞禽。\n我愿从归翼，无然坐自沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}